<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>영어 길잡이 - 귀염뽀짝 5~6학년 영어 받아쓰기 &amp; 영어잡기</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #fff9f0;
      --bg-dots: #ffe8cc;
      --surface: #ffffff;
      --surface-soft: #fff4e6;
      --primary: #ff6b6b;
      --primary-dark: #e04848;
      --secondary: #4ecdc4;
      --secondary-dark: #2ba89f;
      --accent: #ffa94d;
      --accent-dark: #e67700;
      --purple: #845ef7;
      --success: #2b8a3e;
      --success-bg: #ebfbee;
      --danger: #c92a2a;
      --danger-bg: #fff5f5;
      --text: #2b2d42;
      --text-muted: #5c5f77;
      --border: #ffd8a8;
      --radius: 22px;
      --shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(255, 138, 76, 0.14);
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      font-family: "Pretendard", "Apple SD Gothic Neo", "Malgun Gothic", "맑은 고딕", sans-serif;
      background-color: var(--bg);
      background-image: radial-gradient(var(--bg-dots) 2px, transparent 2px);
      background-size: 24px 24px;
      color: var(--text);
      font-size: 18px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .app-header {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff7b7b 0%, #ffa94d 100%);
      color: #ffffff;
      padding: 16px 20px;
      box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(255, 123, 123, 0.25);
      border-bottom-left-radius: 24px;
      border-bottom-right-radius: 24px;
    }

    .header-inner {
      max-width: 980px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .app-title {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 25px;
      font-weight: 900;
      text-shadow: 0 2px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);
    }

    .header-badges {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 8px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .badge {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.28);
      backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
      color: #ffffff;
      padding: 7px 14px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: 800;
      border: 2px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 980px;
      margin: 22px auto 52px;
      padding: 0 16px;
    }

    .card {
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 3px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 24px;
      margin-bottom: 22px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    }

    .card-title {
      margin: 0 0 14px;
      font-size: 23px;
      font-weight: 900;
      color: #d9480f;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .guide-box {
      background: var(--surface-soft);
      border: 2px dashed #ffa94d;
      border-radius: 18px;
      padding: 15px 18px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #3d2c1e;
    }

    .form-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(210px, 1fr));
      gap: 16px;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    label {
      display: block;
      font-weight: 800;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
      color: var(--text);
      font-size: 18px;
    }

    input[type="text"],
    input[type="number"],
    select,
    textarea {
      width: 100%;
      min-height: 52px;
      padding: 10px 14px;
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: 600;
      border: 2.5px solid #ffd8a8;
      border-radius: 14px;
      background: #fffdf9;
      color: var(--text);
      font-family: inherit;
    }

    input:focus,
    select:focus,
    textarea:focus {
      outline: 3px solid #ffe066;
      border-color: var(--primary);
      background: #ffffff;
    }

    .btn-row {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 12px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    button {
      min-height: 52px;
      padding: 12px 20px;
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: 800;
      border-radius: 16px;
      border: 2.5px solid transparent;
      cursor: pointer;
      font-family: inherit;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 8px;
      transition: transform 0.08s ease, box-shadow 0.15s ease, background-color 0.15s ease;
    }

    button:hover:not(:disabled) {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }

    button:active:not(:disabled) {
      transform: translateY(1px) scale(0.98);
    }

    button:disabled {
      opacity: 0.5;
      cursor: not-allowed;
      transform: none;
    }

    .btn-primary {
      background: var(--primary);
      color: #ffffff;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 0 var(--primary-dark);
    }

    .btn-secondary {
      background: var(--secondary);
      color: #ffffff;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 0 var(--secondary-dark);
    }

    .btn-warning {
      background: var(--accent);
      color: #ffffff;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 0 var(--accent-dark);
    }

    .btn-purple {
      background: var(--purple);
      color: #ffffff;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 0 #6741d9;
    }

    .btn-outline {
      background: #ffffff;
      color: #d9480f;
      border-color: #ffa94d;
    }

    .btn-outline:hover:not(:disabled) {
      background: #fff4e6;
    }

    .btn-danger {
      background: #e03131;
      color: #ffffff;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 0 #a61e1e;
    }

    .hidden {
      display: none !important;
    }

    .progress-wrap {
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    .progress-meta {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      font-weight: 800;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      color: #5c5f77;
    }

    .progress-bar {
      width: 100%;
      height: 18px;
      background: #ffe8cc;
      border-radius: 999px;
      overflow: hidden;
      border: 2px solid #ffd8a8;
    }

    .progress-fill {
      height: 100%;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, #ff6b6b, #ffa94d);
      width: 0%;
      transition: width 0.3s ease;
      border-radius: 999px;
    }

    .msg-box {
      padding: 15px 18px;
      border-radius: 16px;
      font-weight: 800;
      margin-top: 14px;
      border: 2.5px solid transparent;
    }

    .msg-info {
      background: #e7f5ff;
      border-color: #74c0fc;
      color: #1864ab;
    }

    .msg-success {
      background: var(--success-bg);
      border-color: #69db7c;
      color: var(--success);
    }

    .msg-error {
      background: var(--danger-bg);
      border-color: #ffa8a8;
      color: var(--danger);
    }

    .msg-warn {
      background: #fff9db;
      border-color: #ffd43b;
      color: #8f5b00;
    }

    .hint-card {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 16px;
      background: #fff9db;
      border: 2.5px solid #ffd43b;
      border-radius: 18px;
      padding: 16px;
      margin-top: 14px;
    }

    .hint-svg-box {
      width: 170px;
      height: 120px;
      background: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 16px;
      border: 2.5px solid #ffe066;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .five-line-box {
      background: #fffef9;
      border: 2.5px solid #ffd8a8;
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 18px;
      margin: 16px 0;
    }

    .five-line-title {
      font-weight: 900;
      color: #d9480f;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      font-size: 19px;
    }

    .staff-svg-wrap {
      width: 100%;
      overflow-x: auto;
      background: #ffffff;
      border: 2px solid #dee2e6;
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 8px;
      margin: 10px 0 14px;
    }

    .repeat-list {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 12px;
      margin-top: 12px;
    }

    .repeat-row {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      background: #fff9f0;
      padding: 10px 12px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      border: 2px solid #ffe8cc;
    }

    .repeat-num {
      min-width: 82px;
      font-weight: 900;
      color: #d9480f;
    }

    .repeat-input {
      flex: 1;
      min-width: 190px;
      font-weight: 800;
      font-size: 20px;
    }

    .repeat-status {
      font-weight: 900;
      min-width: 86px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .enrichment-card {
      background: #ebfbee;
      border: 2.5px solid #69db7c;
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 20px;
      margin-top: 14px;
    }

    .portfolio-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
      gap: 14px;
      margin-top: 12px;
    }

    .word-chip {
      border: 2.5px solid #ffd8a8;
      border-radius: 18px;
      padding: 16px;
      background: #ffffff;
    }

    .word-chip.wrong-type {
      border-left: 8px solid #fa5252;
    }

    .word-chip.advanced-type {
      border-left: 8px solid #40c057;
    }

    /* 단계 & 점수 한눈에 보기 대시보드 */
    .stage-hud-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(150px, 1fr));
      gap: 10px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .hud-box {
      background: #fff9f0;
      border: 2.5px solid #ffd8a8;
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 10px 12px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .hud-box.highlight-stage {
      background: #e7f5ff;
      border-color: #4dabf7;
    }

    .hud-box.highlight-score {
      background: #ebfbee;
      border-color: #51cf66;
    }

    .hud-label {
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: #5c5f77;
    }

    .hud-value {
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: 900;
      color: #2b2d42;
      margin-top: 2px;
    }

    .stage-roadmap {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
      gap: 8px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .stage-chip {
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 8px 6px;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 800;
      background: #f8f9fa;
      border: 2px solid #dee2e6;
      color: #5c5f77;
    }

    .stage-chip.current {
      background: #fff9db;
      border-color: #fab005;
      color: #b56900;
    }

    .stage-chip.cleared {
      background: #ebfbee;
      border-color: #69db7c;
      color: #2b8a3e;
    }

    /* 영어잡기 배경 일러스트 + 낙하 스테이지 */
    .sky-drop-stage {
      position: relative;
      width: 100%;
      height: 330px;
      border-radius: 22px;
      border: 3px solid #4dabf7;
      overflow: hidden;
      margin: 12px 0;
      box-shadow: inset 0 0 24px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.45);
    }

    .stage-bg-svg {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      z-index: 0;
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .danger-floor {
      position: absolute;
      left: 0;
      right: 0;
      bottom: 0;
      height: 18px;
      background: repeating-linear-gradient(
        45deg,
        #fa5252,
        #fa5252 12px,
        #ffe066 12px,
        #ffe066 24px
      );
      border-top: 2px solid #c92a2a;
      z-index: 2;
    }

    .falling-word-bubble {
      position: absolute;
      transform: translateX(-50%);
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.96);
      border: 3px solid #ff6b6b;
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 8px 16px;
      box-shadow: 0 6px 14px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.16);
      text-align: center;
      white-space: nowrap;
      z-index: 3;
    }

    .falling-word-bubble.sentence-bubble {
      border-color: #845ef7;
      background: rgba(248, 240, 252, 0.97);
    }

    .falling-word-en {
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: 900;
      color: #2b2d42;
    }

    .falling-word-ko {
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #d9480f;
    }

    .scoreboard {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .score-pill {
      flex: 1;
      min-width: 160px;
      background: #e7f5ff;
      border: 2.5px solid #4dabf7;
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 10px 12px;
      text-align: center;
      font-weight: 900;
    }

    .score-pill.active-turn {
      background: #fff9db;
      border-color: #fab005;
    }

    .teacher-tabs {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 10px;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    .summary-stats {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(180px, 1fr));
      gap: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    .stat-box {
      background: #fff9f0;
      border: 2.5px solid #ffd8a8;
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 14px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .stat-num {
      font-size: 24px;
      font-weight: 900;
      color: #d9480f;
    }

    .result-card {
      border: 2.5px solid #ffd8a8;
      border-radius: 18px;
      padding: 16px;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
      background: #ffffff;
    }

    .result-header {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 8px;
      font-weight: 900;
      font-size: 19px;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .score-tag {
      background: #ebfbee;
      color: #2b8a3e;
      padding: 4px 12px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      border: 1.5px solid #69db7c;
      font-size: 16px;
    }

    .teacher-item {
      border: 2px solid #ffd8a8;
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 14px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      background: #fffdf9;
    }

    .storage-notice {
      font-size: 15px;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      margin-top: 10px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    @media (max-width: 650px) {
      .app-title {
        font-size: 21px;
      }
      .card {
        padding: 18px;
      }
      .stage-roadmap {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      }
      .sky-drop-stage {
        height: 290px;
      }
    }
  
    /* ===== 복사·붙여넣기 및 텍스트 선택 제한 ===== */
    html, body, body * {
      -webkit-user-select: none !important;
      user-select: none !important;
      -webkit-touch-callout: none !important;
    }
    input, textarea {
      -webkit-user-select: text !important;
      user-select: text !important;
    }
    /* ===== 다듬기 패치 ===== */
    button:focus-visible {
      outline: 3px solid #ffe066;
      outline-offset: 2px;
    }
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      * { transition: none !important; scroll-behavior: auto !important; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header class="app-header">
    <div class="header-inner">
      <h1 class="app-title">🐰 영어 길잡이 (5·6학년 영어 받아쓰기 &amp; 영어잡기)</h1>
      <div class="header-badges">
        <span id="badgeStudent" class="badge">학년·반·번호 미입력</span>
        <button type="button" id="btnToggleSound" class="btn-outline" style="min-height: 48px; padding: 8px 14px;">🎵 소리 ON</button>
        <button type="button" id="btnNavHome" class="btn-outline" style="min-height: 48px; padding: 8px 14px;">🏠 처음</button>
        <button type="button" id="btnNavPortfolio" class="btn-outline" style="min-height: 48px; padding: 8px 14px;">📒 내 단어장</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="container">
    <!-- 1. 첫 화면 -->
    <section id="screenHome" class="card">
      <h2 class="card-title">✨ 오늘도 신나게 영어 받아쓰기!</h2>
      <div class="guide-box">
        🐣 학년·반·번호와 단원을 고른 뒤 <strong>받아쓰기 시작하기</strong>를 눌러 보세요!<br />
        🎨 틀리면 <strong>단어 뜻 그림 힌트</strong>와 <strong>영어공책 5선지 글씨 모양</strong>으로 5번 연습해요!
      </div>

      <div class="form-grid">
        <div>
          <label for="selectGrade">학년 선택</label>
          <select id="selectGrade">
            <option value="5">5학년</option>
            <option value="6">6학년</option>
          </select>
        </div>
        <div>
          <label for="inputClass">반 (숫자)</label>
          <input type="number" id="inputClass" min="1" max="20" placeholder="예: 6" />
        </div>
        <div>
          <label for="inputNumber">번호 (숫자)</label>
          <input type="number" id="inputNumber" min="1" max="50" placeholder="예: 12" />
        </div>
        <div>
          <label for="selectUnit">2022 교육과정 단원 선택</label>
          <select id="selectUnit"></select>
        </div>
        <div>
          <label for="selectMode">문제 유형</label>
          <select id="selectMode">
            <option value="all">단어 + 문장 모두 풀기</option>
            <option value="word">핵심 단어만 풀기</option>
            <option value="sentence">핵심 문장만 풀기</option>
          </select>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div id="homeAlert" class="msg-box msg-error hidden"></div>

      <div class="btn-row">
        <button type="button" id="btnStartStudy" class="btn-primary">🚀 받아쓰기 시작하기</button>
        <button type="button" id="btnOpenPortfolioFromHome" class="btn-secondary">📒 나만의 단어장</button>
        <button type="button" id="btnOpenGameFromHome" class="btn-warning">🎯 영어잡기 게임</button>
        <button type="button" id="btnOpenTeacher" class="btn-purple">👩‍🏫 교사용 공간(문제·결과)</button>
      </div>
      <p id="storageStatusText" class="storage-notice"></p>
    </section>

    <!-- 2. 받아쓰기 학습 화면 -->
    <section id="screenStudy" class="card hidden">
      <div class="progress-wrap">
        <div class="progress-meta">
          <span id="studyUnitLabel">단원</span>
          <span id="studyProgressText">1 / 5 문제</span>
        </div>
        <div class="progress-bar">
          <div id="studyProgressFill" class="progress-fill"></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h2 id="studyQuestionTitle" class="card-title">🎧 원어민 소리를 듣고 써 보세요</h2>

      <div class="btn-row" style="margin-bottom: 14px;">
        <button type="button" id="btnSpeakNormal" class="btn-primary">🔊 원어민 발음 듣기</button>
        <button type="button" id="btnSpeakSlow" class="btn-outline">🐢 천천히 듣기</button>
      </div>
      <div id="ttsFallbackBox" class="msg-box msg-info hidden"></div>

      <div id="hintCard" class="hint-card hidden">
        <div id="hintSvgBox" class="hint-svg-box"></div>
        <div style="flex: 1; min-width: 200px;">
          <div style="font-weight: 900; color: #d9480f; font-size: 19px; margin-bottom: 4px;">💡 뜻 그림 힌트!</div>
          <div id="hintText" style="font-weight: 700; color: #3d2c1e;"></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="form-grid" style="margin-top: 16px;">
        <div>
          <label for="answerEnglish">영어 단어 또는 문장 쓰기</label>
          <input type="text" id="answerEnglish" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false" placeholder="영어로 입력해 보세요" />
        </div>
        <div>
          <label for="answerMeaning">우리말 뜻 쓰기 (비슷한 뜻도 정답!)</label>
          <input type="text" id="answerMeaning" autocomplete="off" placeholder="예: 아침을 먹다" />
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="btn-row">
        <button type="button" id="btnCheckAnswer" class="btn-primary">✅ 정답 확인하기</button>
        <button type="button" id="btnNextQuestion" class="btn-secondary hidden">➡️ 다음 문제로 가기</button>
      </div>

      <div id="feedbackBox" class="msg-box hidden"></div>

      <div id="fiveLinePracticeArea" class="five-line-box hidden">
        <div class="five-line-title">📏 영어공책 5선지 글씨 가이드 (빨간색 글씨는 틀렸던 부분이에요!)</div>
        <div style="font-size: 16px; color: #5c5f77; margin-bottom: 6px; font-weight: 700;">
